-----------------------------------------------------------------------------
Bundling
-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

This package is produced by scripts/build-telemetry-binaries.sh in the
@infinitedusky/indusk-mcp monorepo. No modifications are made to the upstream
binaries; they are extracted from upstream's own release tarballs and repacked
into the platform-specific npm package for consumption by the local-telemetry
extension.

If you are looking for the upstream projects' primary distribution channels,
use the links above. This package exists only to simplify installation for
@infinitedusky/indusk-mcp consumers — it is not a fork.
